Mouse Bite Labs
---------------

This bot was built to help with Mouse Bite Labs' flash cartridge boards, which
are linked from the README and from /dmgdb about. The boards and their
documentation are (c)MouseBiteLabs. Nothing of theirs is reproduced here - the
links are a credit, not a dependency.

    https://github.com/MouseBiteLabs/Game-Boy-Cartridges


No-Intro
--------

rom-list.json holds cartridge header values read from the ROMs themselves.
Its filenames follow the naming conventions of the No-Intro project:

    https://no-intro.org


libretro-thumbnails
-------------------

Box art is linked, not redistributed, from the libretro-thumbnails
repositories, pinned to fixed commits:

    https://github.com/libretro-thumbnails/Nintendo_-_Game_Boy
    https://github.com/libretro-thumbnails/Nintendo_-_Game_Boy_Color


